  description: 
  fileText: '"[Handwritten ledger, multiple authors] - R. given Room 2 priority over
    seniority (Worker 1, 14 months ago). R. exempted from house fee increase (V.''s
    order - Worker 3, 11 months ago). R. elevated to Madam despite objections from
    floor (V.''s sole decision - Workers 1, 2, 3, 4, 9 months ago). R. publicly defended
    by V. after altercation with client (V.''s intervention - Worker 2, 6 months
    ago). [Continues]"'
